Native Outsider	KEY:Magma Para-Genasi ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagmaParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.5	DESC:Magma Para-Genasis are native outsiders.
Elemental Resistance	KEY:Magma Para-Genasi ~ Elemental Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagmaParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.5	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on saving throws against fire spells and effects. The bonus starts at +1 and increases by +1 for every five character levels.|1+floor(TL/5)
