###Block: Ooze Para-Genasi
Race Traits ~ Ooze Para-Genasi	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=OozeParaGenasi Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Ooze Para-Genasi ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OozeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.5	DESC:Ooze Para-Genasis are native outsiders.
Elemental Resistance	KEY:Ooze Para-Genasi ~ Elemental Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OozeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.5	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on saving throws against acid spells and effects. The bonus starts at +1 and increases by +1 for every five character levels.|1+floor(TL/5)
Grease	KEY:Ooze Para-Genasi ~ Grease	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OozeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.5	DESC:Once per day, use grease as a spell-like ability, as a sorcerer of your character level.
Clerical Focus	KEY:Ooze Para-Genasi ~ Clerical Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OozeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.5	DESC:A cleric of this race must worship a deity granting the Earth, Slime, or Water domain, and must select one of those domains.

###Block: Smoke Para-Genasi
Race Traits ~ Smoke Para-Genasi	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Smoke Para-Genasi ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:Smoke Para-Genasis are native outsiders.
Elemental Resistance	KEY:Smoke Para-Genasi ~ Elemental Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on saving throws against smoke and cloud effects (such as stinking cloud and cloudkill). The bonus starts at +1 and increases by +1 for every five character levels.|1+floor(TL/5)
Smoke Cloud	KEY:Smoke Para-Genasi ~ Smoke Cloud	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:Once per day (Su), create the smoke cloud effect of the pyrotechnics spell without needing a fire source, as a sorcerer of your character level.
Clerical Focus	KEY:Smoke Para-Genasi ~ Clerical Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:A cleric of this race must worship a deity granting the Air or Fire domain, and must select one of those domains.

###Block: Steam Para-Genasi
Race Traits ~ Steam Para-Genasi	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=SteamParaGenasi Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Steam Para-Genasi ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SteamParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:Steam Para-Genasis are native outsiders.
Elemental Resistance	KEY:Steam Para-Genasi ~ Elemental Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SteamParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on saving throws against heat-based (but not fire-based) effects, such as heat metal. The bonus starts at +1 and increases by +1 for every five character levels.|1+floor(TL/5)
Obscuring Mist	KEY:Steam Para-Genasi ~ Obscuring Mist	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SteamParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:Once per day, use obscuring mist as a spell-like ability, as a druid of your character level.
Clerical Focus	KEY:Steam Para-Genasi ~ Clerical Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SteamParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:A cleric of this race must worship a deity granting the Fire or Water domain, and must select one of those domains.
Keen Eyed	KEY:Steam Para-Genasi ~ Keen Eyed	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SteamParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:(Ex) Reduce the miss chance from concealment caused by smoke, fog, and similar atmospheric effects by 10%%.

###Block: Mortif
Race Traits ~ Mortif	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=Mortif Race Trait
Deathtouched	KEY:Mortif ~ Deathtouched	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mortif Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.7	DESC:Mortif are deathtouched humans whose ancestry includes an undead or half-undead creature.
Racial Skills	KEY:Mortif ~ Racial Skills	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mortif Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.7	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Intimidate and Move Silently checks.
Chill Touch	KEY:Mortif ~ Chill Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Mortif Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.7	DESC:Once per day, use chill touch as a spell-like ability (caster level equals character level, minimum 1st).

###Block: Ghost Elf
Race Traits ~ Ghost Elf	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=GhostElf Race Trait
Weapon Proficiency	KEY:Ghost Elf ~ Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GhostElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.8	DESC:Proficient with the short sword and scimitar (but not with bows).
Ghostly Glow	KEY:Ghost Elf ~ Ghostly Glow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GhostElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.8	DESC:Sheds light like a candle (5-foot radius). Suppressing it is a free action, but requires a DC 10 Concentration check (free action) each round.
Keen Senses	KEY:Ghost Elf ~ Keen Senses	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GhostElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.8	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Listen, Search, and Spot checks. Passing within 5 feet of a secret or concealed door entitles a Search check as if actively looking.
Planar Lore	KEY:Ghost Elf ~ Planar Lore	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GhostElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.8	DESC:Knowledge (the planes) is always a class skill.
Ethereal Power	KEY:Ghost Elf ~ Ethereal Power	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GhostElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.8	DESC:Once per day, use one ethereal power available at your level or lower (caster level equals character level). 1st: slip binding (+10 enhancement on Escape Artist for 1 min/level, +20 at 5th, +30 at 9th). 4th: see invisibility. 6th: blink. 14th: ethereal jaunt. 18th: ethereal shift (move yourself and carried gear to or from the Ethereal Plane and remain there). Only one power may be used per day; the spell-like listings are shared.

###Block: Bozak (DMC)
Race Traits ~ Bozak (DMC)	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=BozakDMC Race Trait
Racial Hit Dice	KEY:Bozak (DMC) ~ Racial Hit Dice	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:BozakDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.12	DESC:Four dragon Hit Dice (d12): +4 base attack, Fort/Ref/Will +4, skill points 7 x (6 + Int mod), and two feats.
Spells	KEY:Bozak (DMC) ~ Spells	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:BozakDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.12	DESC:Casts spells as a 4th-level sorcerer. Sorcerer levels stack with this for spells per day, spells known, and caster level (enter manually).
Death Throes	KEY:Bozak (DMC) ~ Death Throes	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:BozakDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.12	DESC:(Su) On death, the bones explode for 1d6 damage in a 10-foot radius (Reflex DC 10 + 1/2 HD + Con mod half). Can only be raised by resurrection, true resurrection, miracle, or wish.
Glide	KEY:Bozak (DMC) ~ Glide	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:BozakDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.12	DESC:(Ex) Negates falling damage and can glide horizontally up to four times the vertical distance descended (clumsy maneuverability).
Inspired by Dragons	KEY:Bozak (DMC) ~ Inspired by Dragons	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:BozakDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.12	DESC:(Ex) +1 morale bonus on attacks and saves when under the command of a dragon.
Low Metabolism	KEY:Bozak (DMC) ~ Low Metabolism	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:BozakDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.12	DESC:(Ex) Needs only one-tenth the food and water of a human.
Spell Resistance	KEY:Bozak (DMC) ~ Spell Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:BozakDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.12	DESC:Spell resistance equal to 14 + class level.

###Block: Tortle (DMC)
Race Traits ~ Tortle (DMC)	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=TortleDMC Race Trait
Swimmer	KEY:Tortle (DMC) ~ Swimmer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TortleDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.14	DESC:Swim speed 10 ft. +8 racial bonus on Swim checks to perform special actions or avoid hazards; may always take 10 on Swim and may run while swimming in a straight line.
Shell	KEY:Tortle (DMC) ~ Shell	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TortleDMC Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.14	DESC:+3 natural armor bonus.

###Block: Adu'ja
Race Traits ~ Adu'ja	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=Aduja Race Trait
Plant Traits	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Plant Traits	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:Immune to mind-affecting effects, poison, sleep, paralysis, polymorph, stunning, and critical hits. Does not sleep (spellcasters still rest 8 hours). Unaffected by effects that target only humanoids.
Woodland Stride	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Woodland Stride	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:Has the woodland stride ability of a 2nd-level druid.
Photosynthesis	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Photosynthesis	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:Needs only one-quarter normal rations if allowed 4 hours of direct sunlight per day.
Photoregeneration	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Photoregeneration	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:Resting in sunlight with at least a gallon of water heals twice the character level in hit points per day. Can regrow severed limbs (not heads) in about a month (half with complete bed rest).
Expressive	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Expressive	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:+4 racial bonus on Diplomacy and Perform checks.
Trusting Nature	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Trusting Nature	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:-4 penalty on Bluff and Sense Motive checks.
Nature Bond	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Nature Bond	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:+4 racial bonus on Survival checks; Survival is always a class skill.
Vulnerability to Fire	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Vulnerability to Fire	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:Takes half again as much (+50%%) damage from fire.
Speak with Plants	KEY:Adu'ja ~ Speak with Plants	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Aduja Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.15	DESC:Once per day, speak with plants as a spell-like ability (caster level 1st).

