Quadrupedal Run	KEY:Gruwaar ~ Quadrupedal Run	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gruwaar Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.17	DESC:In light or no armor, with a light load and empty hands, can drop to all fours and move at 30 ft.
