Swimmer	KEY:T'kel ~ Swimmer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Tkel Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.21	DESC:Swim speed 20 ft. +8 racial bonus on Swim checks for special actions or hazards; may always take 10 and may run while swimming in a straight line.
