###Block: Exiled Dwarf
Race Traits ~ Exiled Dwarf	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=ExiledDwarf Race Trait
Steady Pace	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Steady Pace	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Speed is never reduced by armor or encumbrance (20 ft.).
Open Minded	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Open Minded	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:One extra feat at 1st level. Exiled dwarves lose darkvision, stonecunning, stability, and the racial bonuses against poison and spells.
Weapon Familiarity	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Weapon Familiarity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Dwarven waraxes and dwarven urgroshes are martial weapons.
Vengeance	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Vengeance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+2 racial bonus on attack and damage rolls against orcs and goblinoids.
Giant Fighter	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Giant Fighter	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+6 dodge bonus to Armor Class against monsters of the giant type.
Stone and Metal Lore	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Stone and Metal Lore	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Appraise and Craft checks related to stone or metal items.

###Block: Declining Elf
Race Traits ~ Declining Elf	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=DecliningElf Race Trait
Weapon Proficiency	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Proficient with longsword, rapier, longbow, and shortbow (including composite bows).
Weapon Focus	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Weapon Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Gains Weapon Focus with one melee weapon (longsword or rapier) and one ranged weapon (longbow or shortbow).
Keen Senses	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Keen Senses	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Listen, Search, and Spot checks; can notice secret doors by passing within 5 feet.
Faded Heritage	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Faded Heritage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Declining elves lose sleep immunity, the save bonus against enchantments, and trance (must sleep 8 hours). They age as half-elves.

###Block: Techno Gnome
Race Traits ~ Techno Gnome	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=TechnoGnome Race Trait
Weapon Familiarity	KEY:Techno Gnome ~ Weapon Familiarity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TechnoGnome Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:Gnome hooked hammers are martial weapons.
Racial Combat Training	KEY:Techno Gnome ~ Racial Combat Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TechnoGnome Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:+1 racial bonus on attack rolls against kobolds and goblinoids; +4 dodge bonus to AC against giants.
Mechanical Genius	KEY:Techno Gnome ~ Mechanical Genius	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TechnoGnome Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Craft, Disable Device, and Open Lock checks. Bonus Alertness feat at 1st level.
Lost Magic	KEY:Techno Gnome ~ Lost Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TechnoGnome Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:Techno gnomes lose the save bonus against illusions, the illusion DC bonus, and all racial spell-like abilities.
Keen Hearing	KEY:Techno Gnome ~ Keen Hearing	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TechnoGnome Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Listen checks.

###Block: Unsheltered Halfling
Race Traits ~ Unsheltered Halfling	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=UnshelteredHalfling Race Trait	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Unsheltered Halfling ~ Hardened Defenses|PRELEVEL:MIN=3
Agile	KEY:Unsheltered Halfling ~ Agile	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:UnshelteredHalfling Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Climb, Jump, Listen, and Move Silently checks.
Thrower	KEY:Unsheltered Halfling ~ Thrower	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:UnshelteredHalfling Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:+1 racial bonus on attack rolls with thrown weapons and slings.
Self Reliant	KEY:Unsheltered Halfling ~ Self Reliant	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:UnshelteredHalfling Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:Bonus Dodge feat at 1st level. Unsheltered halflings lose the racial bonus on all saves and the morale bonus against fear.
