Race Traits ~ Umbragen	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=Umbragen Race Trait
Drow Heritage	KEY:Umbragen ~ Drow Heritage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Umbragen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.48	DESC:Umbragen are drow and have all drow racial traits except as noted: darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep, +2 racial bonus on saves against enchantments, spell resistance 11 + class level, light blindness, and +2 on Listen, Search, and Spot (noticing secret doors within 5 feet).
Shadow Bond	KEY:Umbragen ~ Shadow Bond	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Umbragen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.48	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Hide and Move Silently checks (replaces the drow bonus on saves against spells and spell-like abilities).
Weapon Proficiency	KEY:Umbragen ~ Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Umbragen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.48	DESC:Proficient with longbow, shortbow, longsword, and rapier (replaces the drow weapon proficiencies).
Spell-Like Abilities	KEY:Umbragen ~ Spell-Like Abilities	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Umbragen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.48	DESC:1/day dancing lights, darkness, and faerie fire (caster level equals class level).
Light Blindness	KEY:Umbragen ~ Light Blindness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Umbragen Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.48	DESC:Abrupt exposure to bright light blinds for 1 round; afterward, dazzled while in bright light.

###Block: Insectare
Race Traits ~ Insectare	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=Insectare Race Trait
Antenna Rake	KEY:Insectare ~ Antenna Rake	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Insectare Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.52	DESC:Two antenna attacks per round, treated as off-hand weapons (1d4 slashing + 1/2 Strength bonus each), or one antenna as an attack action at the normal bonus.
Chitin Plates	KEY:Insectare ~ Chitin Plates	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Insectare Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.52	DESC:+2 natural armor bonus.
Deceptive	KEY:Insectare ~ Deceptive	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Insectare Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.52	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Bluff and Disguise checks.
Elven Blood	KEY:Insectare ~ Elven Blood	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Insectare Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.52	DESC:Counts as an elf for all race-related effects.

